# Let me manually analyze what changes might occur
inputs = ['uvxkc', 'wi', 'cbfk', 'beuiv', 'ujjixf']
outputs = ['uvxkc', 'ikfu', 'cbfk', 'bdecukfuv', 'ujjkfuxf']

print("Input -> Output analysis:")
for i, (inp, outp) in enumerate(zip(inputs, outputs)):
    print(f"{inp} -> {outp}")

print("\nCharacter-by-character analysis:")
for i, (inp, outp) in enumerate(zip(inputs, outputs)):
    print(f"\n{i+1}. '{inp}' -> '{outp}'")
    if inp != outp:
        print(f"   Length: {len(inp)} -> {len(outp)}")
        # Show differences
        min_len = min(len(inp), len(outp))
        for j in range(min_len):
            if inp[j] != outp[j]:
                print(f"   Position {j}: '{inp[j]}' -> '{outp[j]}'")
        if len(inp) != len(outp):
            if len(inp) < len(outp):
                print(f"   Extra chars in output: '{outp[len(inp):]}'")
            else:
                print(f"   Extra chars in input: '{inp[len(outp):]}'")

